136:## D2 — TESS-truth transplant (DAV signals in real ZTF windows)
137:
138:- Truth: Romero+2022 (MNRAS 511, 1574; arXiv:2201.04158; 74 new DAVs,
139:  TESS Cy1–3) + Romero+2025 (ApJ 984, 112; arXiv:2407.07260; 32 new DAVs,
140:  Cy4–5). Published per-mode tables: period [s] + amplitude [ppt] + per-star
141:  FAP(1/1000) limit + 20-s-cadence flags. 2025 revisions apply: NOV
142:  retractions (TIC 261400271, 804835539, 317620456) and updated mode lists
143:  for re-observed 2022 objects — latest published solution wins.
144:- Truth model, not interpolation (`d2_truth_model.py`): for 120-s sampling,
145:  DAV P < 240 s is super-Nyquist (Nyquist period 240 s) and the boxcar
146:  integration response has its first null at P = 120 s — two distinct
147:  boundaries, both making interpolated TESS photometry undefined in the DAV
148:  range; the mode table is evaluated analytically at the template's real
149:  `bjd_tdb`. Chain: ppt → mag (×1.0857e-3) → de-dilution OFF by default
150:  (SPOC PDCSAP is crowding-corrected; ON = prespecified variant) →
151:  de-integrate the TESS boxcar (signed sinc; REJECT modes with
152:  |sinc| < 0.3, i.e. P < ~160 s at 120-s cadence, P < ~27 s at 20-s);
153:  cadence precedence is algorithmic: cadence_s = 20 iff the star's chosen
154:  published solution includes any "f" (20-s) sector, else 120 →
155:  bandpass ladder A_g/A_TESS ∈ {1.4, 1.7, 2.1} × A_r/A_g ∈
156:  {0.70, 0.80, 0.90}; the blackbody T-derivative at 11,500 K gives
157:  (1.43, 0.80) ≈ the low rung; the ADOPTED nominal (1.7, 0.80) is the grid
158:  midpoint covering atmosphere-model/limb-darkening uncertainty (the ladder
159:  is non-optional — zr carries most published confirmations) →
160:  re-integrate the ZTF 30-s boxcar analytically → compose with the FROZEN
161:  phase protocol: one independent phase per mode; base assignment
162:  (phase_draw = 0) seeds PCG64(TIC) and is shared across bands and across
163:  every bandpass/de-dilution/amplitude-scale variant; the two phase-draw
164:  sensitivity variants d ∈ {1, 2} seed PCG64(TIC·10 + d) and change ONLY
165:  the phase vector; shared t_ref keeps the frozen two-band rule meaningful.
166:- Windows: templates from ALL 928 stars of the published catalog (G1 fix —
167:  the earlier 510-not-detected pool conditioned on the pipeline's own
168:  outcome), matched by median zg mag (|Δg| ≤ 0.25, widened when thin;
169:  flagged), K=3 per target at 10/50/90th percentile of exposures-per-night
170:  (75% of zg nights are single-exposure; per-night median subtraction
171:  annihilates 53% of zg data — pre-registered, stratified: risk 3).
172:  Template matching is a TOTAL deterministic algorithm (zero analyst
173:  discretion): candidate pool = stars with |median_zg − target_G| ≤ 0.25;
174:  if fewer than 3, the pool widens once to ≤ 0.5; if still fewer than 3,
175:  the pool is the 9 smallest |Δmag| stars, magnitude ties broken by
176:  ascending source_id (pandas argsort is stable over the source_id-sorted
177:  stats table); the pool is then sorted lexicographically by
178:  (median exposures-per-night, source_id) — a total order, so no residual
179:  ties — and picks are indices round-half-even(q·(n−1)) for
180:  q ∈ {0.10, 0.50, 0.90} (numpy round). Match label recorded per target.
181:  D2 primary detection is post-injection rule firing (detection-only);
182:  strict frequency matching is the separate frequency-recovery estimand;
183:  native variability in the pool is contextualized by PAIRED UNINJECTED
184:  CONTROLS (95-prefix; stable ids indexed over the sorted 928 pool): one
185:  control shard per unique arm-B template window. W2 stretch: fetch real
186:  ZTF light curves at the 103 Romero positions; usable self-windows form a
187:  SEPARATE DIAGNOSTIC arm — they do not replace or enter the nominal K=3
188:  aggregate.
189:- Arms: B primary (signal + real ZTF mags, real magerr), A diagnostic for
190:  positive injections; arm-A ZERO-AMPLITUDE NULLS are the campaign's sole
191:  confirmatory endpoint (P5, METRICS_SPEC). Gaussian-null false-alarm rate
192:  (`FPR_Gaussian`): 1,000 arm-A zero-amplitude simulations scheduled over
193:  the 928-window frame by deterministic cycling (serial i → sorted-pool
194:  window i mod 928, noise seed = serial); windows repeat, seeds do not.
195:  Verification arm: ~20 SPOC light curves prewhitened to confirm published
